<h2>Risks and responses</h2>

<row>
  <col>
    <h3>Risks</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>One supplier provides a third of our stock</li>
      <li>Currency swings in the East</li>
      <li>Hiring is slower than the plan</li>
    </ul>
  </col>
  <step>
    <col>
      <h3>Responses</h3>

      <ul>
        <li>Qualify a second supplier by December</li>
        <li>Invoice in local currency, hedge the rest</li>
        <li>Two contractors start in November</li>
      </ul>
    </col>
  </step>
</row>
